    {
      "name": "Immobilizing Thrust",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The kobold egg guardian makes a longspear Strike. If the Strike hits, the target must attempt a DC 20 Reflex Saving Throw save. On a failure, the creature is Immobilized until the kobold egg guardian moves, attacks with the longspear, or is no longer wielding the longspear.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Luring Retreat",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "auditory",
        "mental",
        "visual"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The kobold egg guardian screams and Strides up to their Speed. Each enemy who sees or hears the kobold egg guardian must succeed at a DC 17 Will Saving Throw save or be Fascinated by the egg guardian for 1 round. On the creature's turn, it must use at least 1 action (or 2 actions on a critical failure) to move closer to the kobold egg guardian (while avoiding obvious dangers). Regardless of the result of the save, targets are then immune to Luring Retreat for 24 hours.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
